# Readiness contract target for "sysd" (Story 6.12). Reached only when the sysd service reports that it is READY (not merely started).
#
# Contract (the services do not exist yet; see yocto/README.md, "RAUC: mark good"):
#   - the sysd service is Type=notify and sends READY=1 only when it can do its job (engine: audio running; ui: first frame shown; sysd: bus
#     name acquired and /data/config usable);
#   - the service declares RequiredBy=velora-sysd-ready.target and Before=velora-sysd-ready.target;
#   - velora-rauc-mark-good.service Requires= and is After= this target, so a service that fails or never gets ready keeps the slot unmarked.
#
# TODO(Story for the sysd service): PLACEHOLDER dependency set. velora-sysd.service does not exist yet, so this target FAILS to start (fail
# closed): until the real service exists, nothing can mark a slot good. Replace with the real unit when the service lands.
[Unit]
Description=Velora sysd ready
Requires=velora-sysd.service
After=velora-sysd.service
